d 'XTBOUNDPANICO': module to calculate bounds and PANICO testing for cointegration in panels with common factors
d
d  xtboundpanico tests the null hypothesis of a panel spurious
d relationship against panel cointegration when the cross-section
d dependence is generated by unobserved common factors whose number
d and order of integration are unknown. It implements Banerjee and
d Carrion-i-Silvestre (2026, University of Canterbury Working Paper
d 8/2026). 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: cointegration
d KW: cross-section dependence
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261029
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f xtboundpanico_bounds.sthlp
f xtboundpanico_cvgen.do
f xtboundpanico_example.do
f xtboundpanico_methods.sthlp
f xtboundpanico_nfactors.sthlp
f xtboundpanico_panico.sthlp
f xtboundpanico.ado
f xtboundpanico.sthlp
